  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7226201",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722620101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722620101": {
            "id": "722620101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Ooh. The sea here is pretty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620102"
            ]
          },
          "722620102": {
            "id": "722620102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? Dihua Marsh isn't a sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620103"
            ]
          },
          "722620103": {
            "id": "722620103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Its waters are connected to the sea, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620104"
            ]
          },
          "722620104": {
            "id": "722620104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, that's true... but it still feels wrong to call Dihua Marsh the sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620105"
            ]
          },
          "722620105": {
            "id": "722620105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mm... Not really understanding. \"Sea\" and \"Not the Sea,\" what's the difference?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620107",
              "722620111",
              "722620115"
            ]
          },
          "722620107": {
            "id": "722620107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Ooh! Forest water is a bit sweet, so not the sea!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620108"
            ]
          },
          "722620108": {
            "id": "722620108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But if Cider Lake is full of cider, what would it count as...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620109"
            ]
          },
          "722620109": {
            "id": "722620109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something Venti would truly love.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620120"
            ]
          },
          "722620120": {
            "id": "722620120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That issue aside, though. Is it just Paimon, or is Kichiboushi getting better at speaking?"
          },
          "722620111": {
            "id": "722620111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, that's... a rather strict definition. But that brings us back to the question of \"boundaries,\" right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620112"
            ]
          },
          "722620112": {
            "id": "722620112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME} says Dihua Marsh is connected to sea. So the difference between \"land-land\" and \"not-land-land\" is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620113"
            ]
          },
          "722620113": {
            "id": "722620113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Guess your strict definition isn't solving our problems, huh?"
          },
          "722620115": {
            "id": "722620115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "If Dihua Marsh thinks it's a sea, then it's the sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620116"
            ]
          },
          "722620116": {
            "id": "722620116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "So Kichiboushi thinks to be an adeptus, so is an adeptus?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620117"
            ]
          },
          "722620117": {
            "id": "722620117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey! Don't listen to {F#her}{M#him}, Kichiboushi. What in the world are you talking about, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620118"
            ]
          },
          "722620118": {
            "id": "722620118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But though it was kind of messy, you had a good point. You can become any kind of bake-danuki you wanna be, Kichiboushi! Who knows, you might even become a tanuki adeptus!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722620119"
            ]
          },
          "722620119": {
            "id": "722620119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "A tanuki adeptus! Yey!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226202",
      "subQuestName": "Go to a place from which you can view Dihua Marsh",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
